[{"id":"liturgy-25","name":"Liturgy","hymns":[{"id":"nikhora","name":"Nikhora","formats":{"1":[{"name":"Nikhora","contentType":"Text","content":{"paragraphs":[{"columns":[{"content":"All the lands of Jericho:  and the Mount of Olives and Jerusalem:  come and see this great miracle:  which happened at the Wedding at Cana of Galilee.","language":"English"},{"content":"Ni,wra tyrou `nte Ieri,w@  nem `ptwou `nte nijwit nem Ieroucalym@  `amwini `anau `etainis] `n`svyri@  ;y`etacswpi qen `phop `n`tKana `nte ]Galilea.","language":"Coptic"},{"content":"يا كل كور أريحا وجبل الزيتون، وأورشليم تعالوا أنظروا هذه الأعجوبة العظيمة التي صارت في عُرس قانا الجليل.","language":"Arabic"}]},{"columns":[{"content":"This is the first miracle:  performed by our Good Savior:  before His disciples:  and they believed that He was the Christ.","language":"English"},{"content":"Vai pe pihouit `mmyini@  `eta pencwtyr `n`aga;oc@  aif `mpe`m;o `nnefma;ytyc@  aunah] `erof je P=,=c.","language":"Coptic"},{"content":"هذه هي الآية الأولى التي صنعها مخلصنا الصالح أمام تلاميذه وآمنوا به أنه المسيح.","language":"Arabic"}]},{"columns":[{"content":"Jesus of Nazareth, blessed the water and it became wine, no one have seen such wonder, since the times of Adam till today.","language":"English"},{"content":"Iycouc Piremnazare;@ af`cmou `enimwou afaitou `nyrp@ `mpe`hli nau `eou`svyri ec`oni `n;ai@ icjen `Adam sa `eqoun `mvoou.","language":"Coptic"},{"content":"يسوع الناصري، بارك المياه فصيرها خمراً، ما نظر أحد أعجوبة مثل هذه، منذ أدام إلى اليوم.","language":"Arabic"}]},{"columns":[{"content":"Six jars of water, You changed into chosen wine, with Your great glory, in the wedding of Cana of Galilee.","language":"English"},{"content":"Coou `nhudria `mmwou@ ouyrp efcwtp akou`wteb `mmwou@ `ebolqen peknis] `n`wou@ qen `phop `n`Tkana `nte }galile`a.","language":"Coptic"},{"content":"ستة أجران ماء، حولتها إلى خمر مختار، من قِبَل مجدك العظيم، فى عرس قانا الجليل.","language":"Arabic"}]},{"columns":[{"content":"Jesus Christ is the same yesterday, today and forever, in one hypostasis, we worship Him and glorify Him.","language":"English"},{"content":"Iycouc Pi`,rictoc `ncaf nem voou@ `n;of `n;of pe nem sa `eneh@ qen ouhupoctacic `nouwt@ tenouwst `mmof ten]`wou naf.","language":"Coptic"},{"content":"يسوع المسيح هو هو أمس، واليوم وإلى الأبد، بأُقنوم واحد، نسجد له ونمجده.","language":"Arabic"}]},{"columns":[{"content":"Intercede on our behalf, O the Lady of us all the Theotokos, Mary the Mother of our Jesus Christ, that He may forgive us our sins.","language":"English"},{"content":"`Ari`precbeuin `e`hryi `ejwn@ `w ten[oic `nnyb tyren };e`otokoc@ Maria `:mau `mPencwtyr@ `ntef,a nennobi nan `ebol.","language":"Coptic"},{"content":"إشفعي فينا، يا سيدتنا كلنا السيدة والدة الإله، مريم أُم مخلصنا، ليغفر لنا خطايانا.","language":"Arabic"}]}],"contentType":"TextContent"}}],"2":[{"name":"Nikhora","contentType":"Hazzat","content":{"englishHazzat":null,"copticHazzat":"<span class=\"CopticFont\">Ni</span><span class=\"HazzatFont\">zz xx.xs</span><span class=\"CopticFont\">,w</span><span class=\"HazzatFont\">zz.x x.z xs.zvf.<br>\r\nzx v.-c.x cd x xs.<br></span>\r\n<span class=\"CopticFont\">ra</span><span class=\"HazzatFont\">v.</span><span class=\"CopticFont\"> ty</span><span class=\"HazzatFont\">cdaz.zed.zed zed cc.<br>\r\nzed xx </span><span class=\"CopticFont\">rou</span><span class=\"HazzatFont\">zz vv.<br>\r\nx x xS q x.cd.x x x x.cd.z zzx.<br>\r\nz xx.-vv.x cd.cd z cc.x cd.zzw x bb.</span><br><br><br>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"HazzatFont\">zzddzz.xx </span><span class=\"CopticFont\">nte</span><span class=\"HazzatFont\">zz.xx xx.zrffz zzw c.<br>\r\n+zrff xrf.(zw x xs)3zzw.zw x.vv.</span><br>\r\n<span class=\"HazzatFont\">z x zx q x xs.z x zx q zx q zx xs.<br>\r\nzx -x</span><span class=\"CopticFont\"> ne</span><span class=\"HazzatFont\">zx x.x zz.zx x.x.z +xs</span><span class=\"CopticFont\"><br>\r\nIe</span><span class=\"HazzatFont\">zz x</span><span class=\"CopticFont\">ri</span><span class=\"Ha